  "description": "LEZDEC crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C116 H96 N12 O22 Tb4,x(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.562-3.880 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.75-112.04°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C116H96N12O22Tb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
